{
  "id": "PRO.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 23",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou sittest to eat with a ruler, consider diligently what",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before thee:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And put a knife to thy throat, if thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a man given to appetite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not desirous of his dainties: for they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "deceitful meat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labour not to be rich: cease from thine own wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou set thine eyes upon that which is not? for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "riches",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "certainly make themselves wings; they fly away as an eagle toward heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eat thou not the bread of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him that hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an evil eye, neither desire thou his dainty meats:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as he thinketh in his heart, so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he: Eat and drink, saith he to thee; but his heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not with thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The morsel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou hast eaten shalt thou vomit up, and lose thy sweet words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak not in the ears of a fool: for he will despise the wisdom of thy words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remove not the old landmark; and enter not into the fields of the fatherless:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For their redeemer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mighty; he shall plead their cause with thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apply thine heart unto instruction, and thine ears to the words of knowledge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Withhold not correction from the child: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou beatest him with the rod, he shall not die.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt beat him with the rod, and shalt deliver his soul from hell.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, if thine heart be wise, my heart shall rejoice, even mine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, my reins shall rejoice, when thy lips speak right things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not thine heart envy sinners: but",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be thou",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the day long.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For surely there is an end; and thine expectation shall not be cut off.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear thou, my son, and be wise, and guide thine heart in the way.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not among winebibbers; among riotous eaters of flesh:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the drunkard and the glutton shall come to poverty: and drowsiness shall clothe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "a man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with rags.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken unto thy father that begat thee, and despise not thy mother when she is old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buy the truth, and sell",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "also",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wisdom, and instruction, and understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The father of the righteous shall greatly rejoice: and he that begetteth a wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "child",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall have joy of him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy father and thy mother shall be glad, and she that bare thee shall rejoice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, give me thine heart, and let thine eyes observe my ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a whore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a deep ditch; and a strange woman",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a narrow pit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She also lieth in wait as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a prey, and increaseth the transgressors among men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath woe? who hath sorrow? who hath contentions? who hath babbling? who hath wounds without cause? who hath redness of eyes?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They that tarry long at the wine; they that go to seek mixed wine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look not thou upon the wine when it is red, when it giveth his colour in the cup,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it moveth itself aright.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the last it biteth like a serpent, and stingeth like an adder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thine eyes shall behold strange women, and thine heart shall utter perverse things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, thou shalt be as he that lieth down in the midst of the sea, or as he that lieth upon the top of a mast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have stricken me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shalt thou say, and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was not sick; they have beaten me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I felt",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.23.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not: when shall I awake? I will seek it yet again.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
